MID_MV13_06: <SH>
MID_MV13_06_m002: (grunt exert)
MID_MV13_06_m003: I will take him.
MID_MV13_06_m004: (growling)
MID_MV13_06_m005: (closed-mouth grunt)
MID_MV13_06_m006: (battle roar)
MID_MV13_06_m007: (light effort exert)
MID_MV13_06_m008: (exert as she takes a stance)
MID_MV13_06_m009: (attack exerts)
MID_MV13_06_m010: (attack exerts)
MID_MV13_06_m011: That guy... Fighting this hard makes me think\nhe's got a whole ship's worth of gold on the line.\nDoes he know the queen?
MID_MV13_06_m012: (power-building exert)
MID_MV13_06_m013: (block exert)
MID_MV13_06_m014: (straining exert)
MID_MV13_06_m015: (straining exert)
MID_MV13_06_m016: Your strength is unearthly... Does\nit have the same origin as mine? 
MID_MV13_06_m017: (exert as he tumbles away)
MID_MV13_06_m018: (dodge exert)
MID_MV13_06_m019: (grunts of pain)
MID_MV13_06_m020: (small exhale)
MID_MV13_06_m021: (small, satisfied exhale)
MID_MV13_06_m022: I owe you.
MID_MV13_06_m023: Don't thank me yet. Let's win this first.
MID_MV13_06_m024: (groan as he stands)
MID_MV13_06_m025: That face... I know who you are.
MID_MV13_06_m026: (pained sound)
MID_MV13_06_m027: Murderous eyes... Never will I forget. Bahr Vahn!
MID_MV13_06_m028: The voice is speaking to me again. I hear it...
MID_MV13_06_m029: The power your arm will give me once I take it...\nOnly then can I become a demon god in full!
MID_MV13_06_m030: Your delusions will end today.
MID_MV13_06_m031: (pained sounds)
MID_MV13_06_m032: In this battle...I see that we are alike.
MID_MV13_06_m033: (dark chuckling)